# Wave W17-Y (Gallant Cavern): keep floor — shore-cavern flags, embankment-stone joints: warm dressed stone flags laid in regular joints, the same keeping as the embankment above carried under the hill (design: the cave keeps the north shore — the lake’s own line; the cavern pool stands byte-preserved in it). Gallant Cavern’s own floor — split from its twin Insight Cavern by temperature entire (warm dressed shore stone vs frost and glint) and from the Ruined Path’s broken grey flags by condition: this floor is kept, that one fell in.
